WEBVTT

00:04:59.956 --> 00:05:02.636
"create," "cow."

00:05:03.516 --> 00:05:05.276
Has it always been this offensive?

00:05:05.276 --> 00:05:06.436
No.

00:05:09.636 --> 00:05:10.876
But we'll talk about this.

00:05:10.916 --> 00:05:14.236
So when we talk about these words,
"vulva," "vagina,"

00:05:14.276 --> 00:05:17.556
trying to offer more palatable
alternatives to "cunt,"

00:05:17.596 --> 00:05:20.036
"vagina," the word turns up
in the 17th century.

00:05:20.076 --> 00:05:23.556
It's taken directly from Latin
and it means a scabbard.

00:05:24.156 --> 00:05:27.036
It means something that a sword goes into.

00:05:28.276 --> 00:05:30.076
"Vulva" doesn't do much better.